[ti:Asmekti n tuzzma]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Tiɣṛi n Yemma]
[length:4:55]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:00.73] Ssmektayeɣ-d tmenṭac
[00:09.92] Mi akken teǧǧuǧǧeg temẓi-w
[00:22.70] Ur d-cligeɣ di tqeṛṛac
[00:30.82] I d-iyi-d-tettheggi temɣer-iw
[00:42.90] Nnulfan-d leɛyub geddac
[00:48.38] Am taḍudt ɣef uqerdac
[00:55.09] Inneslax akk weglim-iw
[01:06.12] Lɛeql ara yenhun iḍac
[01:11.27] Ur yelli d akbal d aḥbac
[01:18.23] I d-iyi-d-yuǧew ufus-iw
[01:33.03]
[01:47.64] A wi kem-isfaqen a temẓi
[01:50.87] Uqbel ad d-teḥḍer tewser
[01:53.73] Tili ur nḥedder i tigi
[01:56.93] Ur gezzem abrid i liser
[01:59.90] Rriɣ afrag i tayri
[02:02.46] Ttarraɣ-tt kan i nnhati
[02:05.56] Taɛzizt-iw mi ara d-tettwibder
[02:08.23] S ccfayat akked imeṭṭi
[02:11.42] S way-s zzuzuneɣ iɣef-iw
[02:14.15] Xas akkenni deg iɣeblan nezder
[02:17.23]
[02:32.10] Limer d-tettuɣal temẓi
[02:34.96] Limer d i d-zewwir temɣer
[02:37.49] I tayeḍ, tayeḍ ad twehhi
[02:40.93] Abrid anda akken inxer
[02:43.71] Adif alama yefsi
[02:46.31] I d-nesmektay zik-nni
[02:49.41] Di nndama i yeɛziz limer
[02:52.08] Tili ass-agi ad d-nesfaydi
[02:55.17] Deg wayen nḍeyyeɛ iḍelli
[02:58.21] Amezruy ḥedd ma ad yenker
[03:01.26]
[03:16.13] Imi d aḥebber i d tudert
[03:18.83] Acu yernan tamara
[03:21.10] Imi ddunit d aserwet
[03:24.63] Mmlet-iyi acu ay d taggara
[03:27.39] Win yewwten yeqqar yettewet
[03:30.34] Bu tidet yeggul yeḥnet
[03:33.29] Ɣef lmektub nezga ntekka
[03:36.07] Ɣef kra n lmut bninet
[03:39.19] Qqaren-asen ur ḥebbset nɣet
[03:42.10] Neḥyaw w nmutu ɛliha
[03:45.09]
[03:59.75] Tebrek amek ara as-semmin
[04:02.75] Limer ur d-udren temlel
[04:05.33] Muḥal ad d-xelqent tismin
[04:08.69] Ass mi akken i d-ilul ddɣel
[04:11.37] A tiṭ-iw sikked aẓ akin
[04:14.17] Mmager ayen iɣ-iggunin
[04:17.23] Ur aɣ-d-tettaf tegnit neɣfel
[04:19.99] Am yergazen am tulawin
[04:23.06] Nɛemmed ad negrent tudrin
[04:26.28] Wala ad yenger laṣel
[04:28.86] Am yergazen am tulawin
[04:31.84] Nɛemmed ad negrent tudrin
[04:37.27] Wala ad yenger laṣel
